# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Python toolkit for randomization-based quantum noise characterization.\n"
msgstr "Isang Python toolkit para sa randomization-based na quantum noise characterization.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  **Alpha software.** This library is in the `0.x` stage of development and under active development. No part of the public interface is yet stable: while the major version is `0`, expect breaking changes between releases and pin your dependency accordingly (for example, `qiskit-noise-learning==0.1.*`). We do not currently issue deprecation warnings, but all changes are recorded in the [release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/release-notes). See the [deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-noise-learning/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md) for details. All feedback is appreciated.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Tala\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  **Alpha software.** Ang library na ito ay nasa `0.x` na yugto ng development at aktibong dine-develop. Wala pang bahagi ng public interface ang stable: habang `0` ang major version, asahan ang mga breaking change sa pagitan ng mga release at i-pin ang dependency mo nang naaayon (halimbawa, `qiskit-noise-learning==0.1.*`). Sa kasalukuyan ay hindi kami nag-iisyu ng mga deprecation warning, pero lahat ng pagbabago ay nakatala sa [release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/release-notes). Tingnan ang [deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-noise-learning/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md) para sa mga detalye. Malaki ang pasasalamat namin sa lahat ng feedback.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Interfaces and Documentation {#interfaces-and-documentation}"
msgstr "Mga Interface at Dokumentasyon {#interfaces-and-documentation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This library has two levels of interface. The first is the low-level interface where the user directly interacts with objects representing core concepts in noise learning, enabling custom design of every aspect of a noise learning protocol. The second is a higher-level interface, the `qiskit_noise_learning.protocols` subpackage, which holds one pair of functions per protocol – `prepare_vanilla_program` and `process_vanilla_result` for the standard “vanilla” protocol – each pair wrapping a stock workflow into a single call on either side of execution.\n"
msgstr "Ang library na ito ay may dalawang antas ng interface. Ang una ay ang low-level na interface kung saan direktang nakikipag-ugnayan ang user sa mga object na kumakatawan sa mga pangunahing konsepto sa noise learning, na nagbibigay-daan sa custom na disenyo ng bawat aspeto ng isang noise learning protocol. Ang ikalawa ay isang higher-level na interface, ang `qiskit_noise_learning.protocols` subpackage, na may hawak na isang pares ng function bawat protocol – `prepare_vanilla_program` at `process_vanilla_result` para sa standard na “vanilla” protocol – kung saan binabalot ng bawat pares ang isang stock workflow sa iisang call sa magkabilang panig ng execution.\n"

